---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import ContactForm from "@/components/global/ContactForm.astro";
import Adventure from "../content/images/page/about/Adventure.webp";
import heyjoacimeldre from "../content/images/page/about/heyjoacimeldre.svg";

export const prerender = true;
---

<BaseLayout
    title="About - Joacim Eldre"
    description="Joacim Eldre is a boy (guy?) who designs, adventure, and love most things yellow."
    image="/og_about.png"
>
    <section>
        <div class="pt-16 max-w-xl2">
            <h1 class="typo-display-xl mb-4">
                I'm Joacim.
            </h1>
            <p class="mt-6 typo-main">
                I like doing. Making. Designing. Drawing. Reading. Discovering. Building. Writing. Sharing. Helping. Playing. Learning. Adventuring. Laughing. Living. Loving.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-6 typo-main">
                And I like to find and solve problems. The joy in figuring out why a thing doesn't work, and then fixing the thing so it works better than before.            </p>
            <Image
                src={heyjoacimeldre}
                alt="A self portrait of me drawn by me, a boy with fuzzy hair, waving at you"
                class="mt-6 w-80"
            />
            <p class="mt-6 typo-main">
                I'm formally educated as a visual designer and game designer, and I have a strong interest in and some work experience with code. I'm exploring how to become more proficient in writing code, and I bring a design mindset into that journey, reiterating fast to get something, test, and adjust.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-6 typo-main">
                During most days I design (and configure and operate, but this is the less fun part so let's not talk about that) software in public healthcare. We're currently working on remote patient care, and patient flow inside the hospital.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-6 typo-main">
                In my spare time I spend as much time as I can with family and friends, draw, design, play video games, make video games, use my hands on crafty things like knitting and woodworking, and go on adventures near and far.
            </p>
            <Image
                src={Adventure}
                alt="A photo of my son and me on a hiking adventure in a forest, I've drawn a bunch doodles around us."
                title="My son and me on an adventure"
                class="mt-12 rounded-lg mx-auto"
            />
            <h2
                class="mt-8 typo-display-lg mb-4"
            >
                I really like
            </h2>
            <ul
                class="list-disc list-inside mt-6 typo-main space-y-2"
            >
                <li>design systems.</li>
                <li>visual design.</li>
                <!-- prettier-ignore -->
                <li><span class="inline-highlight inline-highlight-chip bg-accent-50" style="--selection-highlight: var(--color-accent-50);">yellow.</span></li>
                <li>patterns.</li>
                <li>listening to rain.</li>
                <li>drawing.</li>
                <li>video games.</li>
            </ul>
            <h2 class="mt-8 typo-display-lg mb-4">
                Play
            </h2>
            <p class="mt-6 typo-main">
                My kids and I like to play. The ground is lava is a favourite. A fun way to get time, and distance to pass! We step on small rocks and grass patches, and balance along fallen trees to stay alive.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-6 typo-main">
                I also make tiny video games (see <a href="/posts/2026-06-12-bloob-final/">Bloob</a>, <a href="/posts/2026-07-22-shapedrifter/">Shapedrifter</a>, and <a href="/posts/2026-09-28-stack-a-snack/">Stack a Snack</a>) for my kids and me to play. They push me to have more fun!
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>
</BaseLayout>
